      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One authenticated entry",
      "items": [
        "The platform admits each HTTP request and WebSocket to its owner’s space.",
        "DSH remains external and unmodified; integration uses official seams."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Separate persistent data",
      "items": [
        "Each member mounts only their own home and workspace.",
        "Provider keys stay in platform storage and outgoing gateway requests."
